  "snp2.1:3.5": "The asseveration of truth—the belief that “by this truth” (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>tena saccena</i>, also at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn86/en/sujato#15.2'>MN 86:15.2</a>) effective results could be won—can be traced to Rig Veda 1.21.6 (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>tena satyena</i>). ",
